%h1 Hushaboom

%p.lead
  A simple white noise and ambient sound app for iPhone, iPad, and Mac.

%p
  Seven sounds you can mix together: white, pink, and brown noise, plus ocean,
  wind, rain, and trees. The nature sounds are synthesized rather than sampled,
  so nothing loops.

%p
  No ads. No tracking. No account. No network code at all.

